WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:14,380
I'm taking the aroma clear, the astro clear, and the sulfur as I have had good

00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:18,380
blood tests for the last two years. I'm 75 years old. Recently I read that

00:00:18,380 --> 00:00:23,900
there's some natural progesterone cream made from yams. Would this be a good

00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:29,020
thing to put on? Do you think this would be helpful for you to do? Why or why not?

00:00:29,020 --> 00:00:36,020
So if a person has, let's say they have colon cancer, let's say they have, you know,

00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:42,400
brain cancer. Let's say they have a cancer that any cancer that is not

00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:46,700
hormonally driven in any way or has a chance to be in hormonally driven, then

00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:57,180
you're fine using progesterone cream. If you have a cancer that is hormonally

00:00:57,180 --> 00:01:01,580
driven, then you do not want to use progesterone cream because progesterone will

00:01:01,580 --> 00:01:07,340
store in the cells and will aromatize into estrogen. So you do not want to use

00:01:07,340 --> 00:01:13,180
progesterone cream if you have a hormonally driven cancer.

